# Trivy suppression policy.
#
# Keep this file empty by default. Add an ignore only when the finding is a
# documented accepted risk, has an owner, and has a remediation issue or expiry.
#
# Valid examples:
# CVE-2026-12345
# AVD-DS-0002
CVE-2026-33671
# Do not suppress secrets. Remove exposed credentials and rotate them instead.
